<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine bolsa cancels Ipako's listing due merger.</title>
<headline>Argentine bolsa cancels Ipako's listing due merger.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Buenos Aires Stock Exchange said Monday it was withdrawing from next Friday the listing of shares of petrochemical firm Ipako due to its recent absorption by agroindustrial holding company GyZ Garovaglio &amp; Zorraquin.</p>
<p>The bolsa added minority Ipako shareholders will get Garovaglio's shares in exchange for Ipako's stock.</p>
<p>(-Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650-)</p>
